{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/4f2603413098937a5d083056c73d3525.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=100 /></span>Your kitten picked the wrong place be curious... since this crypt was home to a secret cult who worshiped an ancient entity known only as <i>The Veiled One</i>... an entity that can travel between hosts!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.mp4?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.mp4?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.mp4?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>They built this crypt as both temple and prison. Legends say a ritual went wrong: instead of summoning the entity, they trapped it here, sealed beneath stone and sigil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.mp4?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, the crypt faded into obscurity, whispered only in fragments:<br>\u00a0<br><i>\u201cA treasure greater than any king\u2019s ransom lies within.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cNo soul returns once the silence begins to whisper.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe stones themselves hunger.\u201d</i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.mp4?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i>   <br>    <br>  This crypt contains so much treasure and gold buried deep below that a mine cart system was built in an effort to extract it to the surface... however the greedy miners may have under-estimated the ghostly\u00a0inhabitants. Get ready for a wild cart ride that can lead you off the rails to the darkest of chasms should you not switch tracks quickly enough.    <br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.mp4?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Edge of Evil</strong> is a horror experience that will take you deep below, through dark twisted passages and into the depths of a long forgotten locked crypt in search of answers to an ancient seal that has been broken, unleashing a powerful presence from the mysterious <i><strong>&quot;Black World&quot;</strong></i>\u00a0 \u00a0<br> \u00a0\u00a0<br>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.mp4?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong>     <br><strong> </strong>     <br><strong>A Truly</strong>\u00a0<strong>Haunting Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and immersive sounds as well as a minimal user interface ensure a totally visceral horror experience; forcing you to continuously question your own senses... just beyond, and right up to the <i><strong>edge.</strong></i>.. <br><br><br>- Realistic Graphics        <br>- Immersive Sound And Music       <br>- Eerie Ambience And Atmosphere       <br>- Intriguing Puzzles And Traps       <br>- Interesting Characters <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Does digging up graves sound like fun?  You would be surprised what you can find buried in this crypt... treasure, secret passages and a dark hidden past. But don't dig too deep or you might uncover something that probably should stay buried.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.poster.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.webm?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.mp4?t=1769014841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/f18408b0e956cf1be386528de696b6eb.avif?t=1769014841\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/3c44dfae3b10ee67390fdb65116006ca.avif?t=1769014841\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928510?t=1769014841","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928510?t=1769014841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/0189429b2af12feb6682e46385a3843ea1705a87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769014841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/0189429b2af12feb6682e46385a3843ea1705a87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769014841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4209340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/4f2603413098937a5d083056c73d3525.avif?t=1769014841\" width=800 height=100 /></span>Your kitten picked the wrong place be curious... since this crypt was home to a secret cult who worshiped an ancient entity known only as <i>The Veiled One</i>... an entity that can travel between hosts!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite